    "return_type": "Arc<TradeFilterInteractor>",
    "doc": "Create a `TradeFilterInteractor` (V2 Pure) that shares this session.\n\nSessioned-kernel factory for the orders/positions instrument filter\nsheet (mirrors `create_pure_order_list_interactor`). The filter\ninteractor is a child node of the trade-session tree: it subscribes to\n`TradeUpdate` so the supported-type set / charge\ngroups rebuild on a biz-type switch. It sources its tab/chip/row business\nfrom the Rust biz layer (`OkBizTrait` + inst-group data), replacing the\nnative `TradeInstEntryLoader` + `TradeInstFilterSheetDataSource`\nOKTradeCore reads (R-MIG-370). The OKMarket cross-tab search stays\nKotlin-side (migration brief §4); P3 wires its results back in."
  },
